[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13381.429, "timestamp": "03:43:01", "text": "四、我忘了具体数字。 [笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13386.55, "timestamp": "03:43:06", "text": "所以，它的作用是，当我直播时，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13390.309, "timestamp": "03:43:10", "text": "它会检查我属于哪个音乐类别"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13394.469, "timestamp": "03:43:14", "text": "目前正在流式传输，然后播放"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13398.389, "timestamp": "03:43:18", "text": "从该类别中获取数据。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13400.71, "timestamp": "03:43:20", "text": "所以，如果我在玩《弧光突袭者》，而我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13404.55, "timestamp": "03:43:24", "text": "休息期间，它将播放一段点播视频。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13407.269, "timestamp": "03:43:27", "text": "我的随机播放列表是我们创作者的歌单"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13410.15, "timestamp": "03:43:30", "text": "时间到了，它会在直播中播出，就像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13413.67, "timestamp": "03:43:33", "text": "那。所以，这就是第三版。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13418.229, "timestamp": "03:43:38", "text": "然后我突然想到一个主意。我想重复使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13421.11, "timestamp": "03:43:41", "text": "我喜欢它的第一版和第二版。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13423.429, "timestamp": "03:43:43", "text": "就像是随机抽奖一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13427.51, "timestamp": "03:43:47", "text": "就是那个东西，对吧？所以我当时所做的就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13431.11, "timestamp": "03:43:51", "text": "当我不直播的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13434.63, "timestamp": "03:43:54", "text": "当我不在Twitch上直播的时候"}]